+当前规范是 [本轮 DESIGN v1.1 / A1–A10](../oneshot/runs/20261104-0426-steering-v2/DESIGN.md)。实现、验收命令、结果与真实模型/TUI 证据见 [本轮索引](../oneshot/runs/20261104-0426-steering-v2/README.md)；安装与限制见 [独立包 README](../../external-plugins/steering/README.md)。
